    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "optimal-prefix-sum",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3. Approach 2: Optimal Prefix Sum (Formula)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Instead of looping, we build the prefix sum array `pref` once, and then answer all queries in $O(1)$ constant time by performing a single subtraction: `pref[R] - pref[L - 1]`."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Let's launch the interactive simulator below to see how this executes: first we construct the prefix sum array in memory, and then we answer the two queries instantly using the formula:"
    },
    {
      "type": "simulation",
      "id": "optimal-range-sum-simulation",
      "simulationData": {
        "code": "int arr[5] = {2, 4, 1, 5, 3};\nint pref[5];\n\npref[0] = arr[0];\nfor (int i = 1; i < 5; i++) {\n    pref[i] = pref[i - 1] + arr[i];\n}\n\n// Query 1: L = 1, R = 3\nint sum1 = pref[3] - pref[0];\nstd::cout << \"Query 1: \" << sum1 << \"\\n\";\n\n// Query 2: L = 2, R = 4\nint sum2 = pref[4] - pref[1];\nstd::cout << \"Query 2: \" << sum2 << \"\\n\";",
        "language": "cpp",
        "visualizer": "array",
        "steps": [
          {
            "line": 1,
            "explanation": "We declare the input array `arr` containing values.",
            "variables": [
              { "name": "arr[0]", "type": "int", "value": "2", "address": "0x7FFE00" },
              { "name": "arr[1]", "type": "int", "value": "4", "address": "0x7FFE04" },
              { "name": "arr[2]", "type": "int", "value": "1", "address": "0x7FFE08" },
              { "name": "arr[3]", "type": "int", "value": "5", "address": "0x7FFE0C" },
              { "name": "arr[4]", "type": "int", "value": "3", "address": "0x7FFE10" }
            ],
            "terminalOutput": ""
          },
          {
            "line": 2,
            "explanation": "We allocate the prefix sum array `pref`. Initially it holds garbage values ('?').",
            "variables": [
              { "name": "arr[0]", "type": "int", "value": "2", "address": "0x7FFE00" },
              { "name": "arr[1]", "type": "int", "value": "4", "address": "0x7FFE04" },
              { "name": "arr[2]", "type": "int", "value": "1", "address": "0x7FFE08" },
              { "name": "arr[3]", "type": "int", "value": "5", "address": "0x7FFE0C" },
              { "name": "arr[4]", "type": "int", "value": "3", "address": "0x7FFE10" },
              { "name": "pref[0]", "type": "int", "value": "?", "address": "0x7FFE14" },
              { "name": "pref[1]", "type": "int", "value": "?", "address": "0x7FFE18" },
              { "name": "pref[2]", "type": "int", "value": "?", "address": "0x7FFE1C" },
              { "name": "pref[3]", "type": "int", "value": "?", "address": "0x7FFE20" },
              { "name": "pref[4]", "type": "int", "value": "?", "address": "0x7FFE24" }
            ],
            "terminalOutput": ""
          },
